## Complete Command Reference (Notes)

### 1. Project & File Setup Commands (Codespace Terminal)
```bash
# Create required directories for GitHub Actions
mkdir -p .github/workflows

# Verify file structure
ls -la
ls -la .github/workflows
```

### 2. Local Docker Build & Test Commands
```bash
# Build the Docker image from Dockerfile
docker build -t my-devops-site:local .

# Verify the image was created
docker images

# Run the container in the background (maps host port 8080 -> container port 80)
docker run -d --name my-web-test -p 8080:80 my-devops-site:local

# Check running containers
docker ps

# Verify index.html is served properly
curl http://localhost:8080

# View container logs if troubleshooting is needed
docker logs my-web-test

# Stop and remove the test container
docker rm -f my-web-test
```

### 3. Git Commands to Trigger the Pipeline
```bash
# Check modified or untracked files
git status

# Stage all changes
git add .

# Commit changes with a descriptive message
git commit -m "Update website and CI/CD pipeline"

# Push to GitHub (automatically triggers GitHub Actions)
git push
```

